@startuml umami-sequence
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #555
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #FFF
skinparam noteBorderColor #888
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7

title Hệ thống Monitoring — Umami (Phố Ẩm Thực)

actor "Người dùng\n(Browser / Mobile)" as User
participant "Next.js Frontend\n:3000" as FE
participant "Umami\n:3002" as Umami
database "Umami DB\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB
actor "Dev / Admin" as Dev

== Khởi động — Load script ==

User -> FE : GET /map
activate FE
FE --> User : HTML response

FE -> FE : load <Script src="/umami/script.js">
FE -> Umami : GET /script.js\n(qua Next.js rewrite)
activate Umami
Umami --> FE : umami.js (tracker)
deactivate Umami

note over FE
  data-website-id = WEBSITE_ID
  data-host-url   = "/umami"
  → mọi request tracking đều qua
    Next.js proxy, không lộ IP Umami
end note

deactivate FE

== Tracking trang (Pageview) ==

User -> FE : điều hướng\n/map, /stores, /stores/:id
activate FE
FE -> FE : umami script detect\nURL thay đổi
FE -> Umami : POST /umami/api/send\n{\n  type: "event",\n  payload: {\n    website: "WEBSITE_ID",\n    url: "/map",\n    referrer: "",\n    hostname: "localhost"\n  }\n}
activate Umami
Umami -> DB : INSERT INTO website_event\n(website_id, url, created_at, ...)
DB --> Umami : ok
Umami --> FE : { "ok": true }
deactivate Umami
deactivate FE

== Tracking sự kiện tuỳ chỉnh ==

User -> FE : quét QR thành công
activate FE
FE -> FE : umami.track("qr_scan_success",\n  { type: "store" })
FE -> Umami : POST /umami/api/send\n{\n  type: "event",\n  payload: {\n    website: "WEBSITE_ID",\n    name: "qr_scan_success",\n    data: { type: "store" }\n  }\n}
activate Umami
Umami -> DB : INSERT INTO website_event\n(event_name, event_data, ...)
DB --> Umami : ok
Umami --> FE : { "ok": true }
deactivate Umami
deactivate FE

note right of FE
  Các event tuỳ chỉnh:
  • map_view
  • pin_select
  • directions_request
  • navigation_start
  • qr_scan_success
  • qr_scan_fail
end note

== Xem Dashboard ==

Dev -> Umami : GET http://localhost:3002\n(đăng nhập admin)
activate Umami

Umami -> DB : SELECT COUNT(*) visitors\nWHERE created_at >= today
DB --> Umami : data

Umami -> DB : SELECT url, COUNT(*) views\nGROUP BY url
DB --> Umami : data

Umami -> DB : SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT session_id)\nWHERE last_seen > now()-5min
DB --> Umami : active_users

Umami --> Dev : Dashboard:\n• Online now (realtime)\n• Visitors / Views / Bounce rate\n• Top pages\n• Custom events

deactivate Umami


@enduml
